TI  - Nonlinear regression adjustments of multiple continuous monitoring methods produce effective characterization of short-term fine particulate matter
PY  - 2008
T2  - Journal of the Air and Waste Management Association
VL  - 58
IS  - 6
SP  - 812
EP  - 820
DO  - 10.3155/1047-3289.58.6.812
